+unit's PRSI_ACTION_QUEUE_PATH when running the displayed orchestrator verify
+command: approval belongs to the queue, not the ledger.
+
+Migration before enabling the unit: quiesce ledger writers and copy the existing
+rsi-incidents.json into the configured directory, preserving incident ids and
+resolution evidence. Do not overwrite an existing destination ledger: reconcile
+it under both ledger locks first. No automatic merge or repo-ledger fallback is
+performed. Producers intended for service intake must inherit the override;
+unconfigured interactive producers continue using the separate repo ledger.
